        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.8,
          "en": "Now when using ChatGPT for coding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.8,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "there also is another useful prompting technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 11.37,
          "en": "besides that trick I showed you in the previous lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.37,
          "end": 13.98,
          "en": "And that other technique I'm about to show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.98,
          "end": 17.85,
          "en": "allows you to skip the extra explanations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.85,
          "end": 21.39,
          "en": "ChatGPT tends to add to its responses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.39,
          "end": 25.53,
          "en": "Because here in all the responses I got from ChatGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.53,
          "end": 29.01,
          "en": "it always did not just give me the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.01,
          "end": 32.7,
          "en": "but also always some extra explanations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.7,
          "end": 35.52,
          "en": "and these explanations might be nice to have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.52,
          "end": 39.18,
          "en": "But especially as a developer, you might not need them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.18,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "Therefore, when asking ChatGPT for some code,",
