        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 48.12,
          "en": "you may wanna consider adding another special instruction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.12,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "another piece of context to your prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 55.237,
          "en": "and that instruction should be something like this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.237,
          "end": 56.85,
          "en": "\"Give me just a code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.85,
          "end": 60.36,
          "en": "no extra explanations or text.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.36,
          "end": 63.18,
          "en": "Though as always you might wanna play around with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.18,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "to find the prompt that best works for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 69.51,
          "en": "But when sending this to ChatGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.51,
          "end": 73.593,
          "en": "it should typically just give you the code and nothing else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.97,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "Though here, as you can see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 79.5,
          "en": "it actually took this a bit too far",
